sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: ACP 确认请求的完整往返
  accDescr: 展示、回答和执行分别记录。取消确认也必须回到原请求。
  autonumber
  participant core as Core
  participant adapter as ACP 适配器
  participant client as 客户端
  participant user as 用户
  core->>adapter: ConfirmationRequired
  adapter->>client: request_permission
  client->>user: 显示本次工具参数
  user-->>client: 选择确认结果
  client-->>adapter: 返回原始选项 ID
  adapter-->>core: 提交匹配回答
